OL,3,AMore than 110 rescued a week after
OL,4,ANepal deadly floods, army says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne hundred and nineteen people have
OL,7,Fbeen rescued using air resources in
OL,8,FNepal following deadly floods, a
OL,9,Fspokesperson for the country's army
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FIt comes nearly a week after the
OL,13,Fdisaster that hit both Nepal and
OL,14,Fneighbouring Tibet, killing more than
OL,15,F1,000 people, with more than 3,900
OL,16,Fstill missing.
OL,18,FA Nepali army spokesperson earlier said
OL,19,Fa British male was among those rescued,
OL,20,Falong with 118 Nepalese people, of whom
OL,21,F44 were female and 74 male.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
